            </note>
            <note corresp="#d656-f2" n="46" xml:id="d656-f2-content">
                <p>Joaquin Fernández Fernández, Chilean Minister for Foreign Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d656-f3" n="47" xml:id="d656-f3-content">
                <p>For text of instructions, see <ref target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
